You may download, install, run, study, and copy PTMusic for personal, non-commercial purposes. You may create a non-commercial fork and share unmodified copies, provided you comply with this license.

2. Modification limit
You may modify PTMusic source code, or distribute a modified fork, only when the starting source is an official PTMusic main release under this license whose version ends in .0 (the <year>.<month>.0 form, such as 26.12.0). You may not modify source from a beta or patch release, including 26.9.3, or incorporate such source into a modified fork under this license. You may fork a non-main release without changing it.

3. Credit for forks
Every publicly shared fork must retain existing copyright notices and this license, prominently credit "Based on PTMusic by Phoni Technology" with a link to https://github.com/realphoni/PTMusic, and clearly identify itself as a fork. If you made permitted changes, describe them. Do not imply that Phoni Technology endorses your fork.

